Package: simfirststats
Title: Introduction to Statistics: A Simulation-First Approach
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jeff", "Baggett", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Source for an open (CC BY-SA 3.0) simulation-first introductory
    statistics textbook, adapted from Introduction to Modern Statistics and
    OpenIntro Statistics. This DESCRIPTION exists so the book's R
    dependencies are installable in one step; the repository is a Quarto
    book, not an R package.
License: CC BY-SA 3.0
